#ASSERT `Must the Court order the business to pay` 2000 FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the Court must order the apparent responsible contractor to pay the amount claimed (s 99G(1), (3))`
#ASSERT `Must the Court order the business to pay` 2000 TRUE FALSE EQUALS `no order is required: the apparent responsible contractor has satisfied the Court that the work was not performed (s 99G(3))`
#ASSERT `Must the Court order the business to pay` 2000 FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no order for the amount claimed is required: the apparent responsible contractor has satisfied the Court that it is not the correct amount for the work (s 99G(3))`
#ASSERT `Must the Court order the business to pay` 0 FALSE FALSE EQUALS `nothing to recover: nothing remains payable by the apparent responsible contractor (s 99G(1))`

§§ `ss 104-104C: civil penalties`

`cp yes` MEANS `yes: the application may be made and is in time; the Court may order a civil penalty, part or all of it payable to a particular person, and recoverable as a debt (s 104A(2), (6), (7), (8), (9))`
`cp late` MEANS `no: civil penalty proceedings may be commenced only within 6 years after the day the contravention occurred (s 104A(9))`
`affected` MEANS `I am an employee affected by the contravention`

#ASSERT `Can I apply for a civil penalty order` `affected` (dmy 1 1 2026) (dmy 1 2 2026) FALSE EQUALS `cp yes`
#ASSERT `Can I apply for a civil penalty order` `affected` (dmy 31 12 2025) (dmy 1 2 2026) FALSE EQUALS `no: the contravention happened before 1 January 2026, and the Division applies only to conduct after the 2025 amendments commenced (Fair Work (Worker Entitlements) Amendment Act 2025, Sch 1 cl 4)`
#ASSERT `Can I apply for a civil penalty order` `affected` (dmy 15 3 2026) (dmy 15 3 2032) FALSE EQUALS `cp yes`
#ASSERT `Can I apply for a civil penalty order` `affected` (dmy 15 3 2026) (dmy 16 3 2032) FALSE EQUALS `cp late`
#ASSERT `Can I apply for a civil penalty order` `a registered association entitled to represent my industrial interests` (dmy 15 3 2026) (dmy 1 4 2026) FALSE EQUALS `cp yes`
#ASSERT `Can I apply for a civil penalty order` `an inspector` (dmy 15 3 2026) (dmy 1 4 2026) FALSE EQUALS `cp yes`
#ASSERT `Can I apply for a civil penalty order` `someone else applying for a penalty` (dmy 15 3 2026) (dmy 1 4 2026) FALSE EQUALS `not covered: s 104A(6) names only an affected employee, a registered association entitled to represent the employee's industrial interests, or an inspector`
