#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs in my unfair dismissal case` `I discontinued it` FALSE 15 TRUE TRUE 3 EQUALS `possibly: you discontinued more than 14 days after the conference of the parties concluded and SAET is satisfied you acted unreasonably, so SAET may order you to pay the employer's costs, including representation (s 110(2))`
